@*
    _ValidationScriptsPartial.cshtml — Client-side validation script loader
    Included by views that have forms with data annotations ([Required], [EmailAddress], etc.)
    Usage: @section Scripts { @await Html.PartialAsync("_ValidationScriptsPartial") }
    
    The actual jQuery + validation scripts are loaded from CDN in _Layout.cshtml,
    so this partial is just here for ASP.NET Core scaffold compatibility.
*@
